# Trivy exceptions for HealthQueue. Every entry needs a reason and an expiry date.
# Image and Kubernetes findings only. OpenTofu exceptions are inline in infra/*.tf.

# KSV-0013: image uses the mutable `latest` tag. No image has been published yet,
# so there is no immutable sha-<commit> tag to pin. After the first CI publish,
# set newTag in k8s/base/kustomization.yaml to sha-<commit> and delete this line.
